  "zh": "# 今日热点涵盖 AI 安全事件、字节跳动 AI 业务下线、中国空间站首位外籍航天员、外卖巨头亏损上千亿及消费安全事件等多维度热议。\n\n## AI 与科技\n- **Claude Code 泄露 1,122 个公开 GitHub 密码**：AI 代码审查工具在公开仓库中暴露敏感密码，引发安全担忧\n- **字节跳动 AI 业务下线 市场是否已无可奈何**：字节跳动宣布 AI 业务结束，引发行业对 AI 商业化路径的重新思考\n\n## 国际视野\n- **以色列总统未选内塔尼亚胡 引发国内外关注**：政治变动可能影响地区稳定与国际关系动态\n- **中国空间站迎首位外籍航天员 具有重大意义**：标志着国际合作在太空探索中的重要进展\n\n## 行业动向\n- **外卖巨头三家亏损上千亿 行业竞争白热化**：美团、阿里、京东三家连续亏损，反映外卖市场的激烈竞争\n- **大三男生宿舍 AI 漫剧 营收超 300 万 商业化成功**：AI 应用在真实场景中实现商业化，展示技术落地价值\n\n## 社会民生\n- **中央卫健局回应 夫妻入职药企 1 死 1 瘫痪**：医疗安全事件引发公众对药企监管的关切\n- **河北秦皇岛暴雪 积雪 23 厘米 影响扩大**：极端天气对交通与生活的冲击持续加剧",
  "en": "# Today's hotspots cover AI security incidents, ByteDance's AI business shutdown, China's first foreign astronaut on the space station, e-commerce giants' billions in losses, and consumer safety events across multiple dimensions.\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **Claude Code leaks 1,122 public GitHub passwords**: The AI code review tool exposed credentials in public repos, raising serious security concerns\n- **ByteDance ends AI business lineup market implications**: The company announced the discontinuation of its AI division, prompting industry-wide reevaluation of AI commercialization strategies\n\n## International Outlook\n- **Israel president declines Netanyahu 引发国内外关注**：This political change may impact regional stability and international relations\n- **China's space station welcomes first foreign astronaut**: This marks a significant milestone in international space cooperation\n\n## Industry Trends\n- **Big three e-commerce giants lose billions 激烈 competition**: Meituan, Alibaba, and JD.com have all reported multi-billion losses, reflecting intense market competition\n- **College student AI comic generates 300 million revenue**: AI applications are successfully commercializing in real-world scenarios, demonstrating practical value\n\n## Social & Civil Affairs\n- **State health bureau responds to couple's job at pharma company 1 death 1 paralysis**: This medical safety incident raises public concerns about pharmaceutical company oversight\n- **Hebei Qinhuangdao heavy snow 23cm accumulation**: Extreme weather continues to disrupt transportation and daily life in the region"
